MatchPoint is an AI-powered expertise discovery platform that answers "Who should I talk to?" instead of "Where is the document?" Employees ask a question in natural language, and MatchPoint ranks the most qualified colleagues with a confidence score, explains why they were chosen, and shows how people, projects, and knowledge connect. Companies of every size stop asking around and reach the right person faster.

Companies don't lack information. They lack visibility into who holds it. Knowledge is spread across databases, emails, and recent activity, and nobody has the full picture. MatchPoint brings it together and connects you with the right person in seconds.

Every employee is scored on email topics, project activity, and expertise. Only people with a confidence of at least 55% are suggested, ranked from strongest to weakest match. If nobody is a strong match, MatchPoint says so instead of guessing, so you can trust every name it shows.

Knowledge does not live in documents, knowledge lives in people. MatchPoint makes those people discoverable.
